message: >-
  Please cite the original publication of each instrument version you use
  (listed in the instrument's README.md). To cite STAC as the access point,
  use the preferred citation below.
type: dataset
title: "STAC: Scales and Tasks for Art and Creativity Assessment"
abstract: >-
  Curated, open archive of scales and tasks for research on creativity,
  aesthetics and the arts, plus individual-differences measures commonly used
  alongside them. Migrated 1:1 from the OSF project 4s9p6.
